## Privacy Policy
Effective Date: November 10, 2026

Uni-Chan Thorium ("the Bot", "Uni-Chan Thorium", "the Project") is an experimental artificial intelligence project and Discord bot. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, stored, and processed when you interact with the Bot.

By using Uni-Chan Thorium, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

1. About Uni-Chan Thorium

Uni-Chan Thorium is an experimental Transformer-based AI model developed for educational, research, and learning purposes.

The project is designed to:

Generate conversational responses.
Learn from approved training data.
Evaluate response quality.
Improve future model versions through supervised training and feedback.

Because the project is experimental, responses may be inaccurate, incomplete, or nonsensical.

